{"overview":"لورا همه چیز دارد: شغلی درخشان، همسر مهربان و پسر عزیزش، دانیل. اما زندگی کامل او وقتی دانیل دوست‌دخترش، چری، را به خانه می‌آورد و همه چیز را تغییر می‌دهد، به هم می‌ریزد. پس از معرفی پرتنش، لورا معتقد می‌شود چری رازهایی پنهان می‌کند. آیا او یک صعودگر اجتماعی دست‌کاری‌کننده است یا لورا فقط پارانوئید است؟ حقیقت بسته به دیدگاه هر کس متفاوت است.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Laura has it all: a glittering career, a loving husband, and her precious son, Daniel. But her perfect life unravels when Daniel brings home Cherry, a girlfriend who changes everything. After a tense introduction, Laura becomes convinced Cherry is hiding something. Is she a manipulative social climber, or is Laura just paranoid? The truth is a matter of perspective.","tagline_en":"There are two sides to every story.","runtime":null,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":6,"y":2025,"poster":"/ktrp3tdZ5IQpFux4nLy8z70bt3n.jpg"}],"episodes":6,"crew":["Naomi Sheldon","Gabbie Asher"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["GB","US"],"cast":[{"name":"رابین رایت","role":"Laura Sanderson","photo":"/d3rIv0y2p0jMsQ7ViR7O1606NZa.jpg","en":"Robin Wright"},{"name":"اولیویا کوک","role":"Cherry Laine","photo":"/wf71ctooNlVmiT8dxx0QmRAzyiX.jpg","en":"Olivia Cooke"},{"name":"Laurie Davidson","role":"Daniel Sanderson","photo":"/h2gts4uzqJ7DwusMfIekng78TL.jpg"},{"name":"Waleed Zuaiter","role":"Howard Sanderson","photo":"/tQwaOBIEKnFxTjfTFKrMdSkdSUz.jpg"},{"name":"Karen Henthorn","role":"Tracey Laine","photo":"/bkpZ1bHOHpRnLEF0r9QwjUBwY5b.jpg"},{"name":"Tanya Moodie","role":"Isabella Russell-Bailey","photo":"/zGGeWUCOXH5ktWnNcdSUUPyVbHv.jpg"},{"name":"Shalom Brune-Franklin","role":"Brigitte Russell-Bailey","photo":"/i1obmLM04mtp2yUrYG16sQ5VRgw.jpg"}],"trailer":"SKGdid_6V5s","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/253376-the-girlfriend/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Amazon Prime Video","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/gMZdpavHmxFNnLpMHwVxfqeux2g.png"},{"n":"Amazon Prime Video with Ads","kind":"flatrate